@program qt6-text-input-test
@compositor gnome
@conf hime-edit-display=2
@conf hime-on-the-spot-key=1
# As wl-im-qt6.keys, through GNOME's IBus (hime-ibus):
# A Qt 6 application using text-input (QT_IM_MODULE=wayland).  BackSpace
# takes back the keys typed, then reaches the application.
b 1 a @check <space> b c @check <bs> <bs> <bs> S-h
